    <briefdescription>
<para>Link-health counters and event times (#355). Reported to the host as <computeroutput>DIAG</computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Times are millis() since this boot, 0 = never. Counters saturate at 0xFFFF. The field meanings are the <computeroutput>CAL_DIAG_*</computeroutput> offsets in <ref refid="AxisCal_8h" kindref="compound">AxisCal.h</ref>, which define the wire layout. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
